<title>HONG KONG: HK's outward processing trade to China in Q2.</title>
<headline>HK's outward processing trade to China in Q2.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong's Census and Statistics Department issued the following data on Thursday on the estimated value of the territory's outward processing trade with China in the second quarter of this year.</p>
<p>(Rounded figures in billions of Hong Kong dollars and year-on-year percentage change in brackets)</p>
<p>				    2nd qtr 1996	1st qtr 1996</p>
<p> Total exports to China     58.20 (+ 1.9)     45.48 (- 3.8)</p>
<p> Domestic exports to China  10.85 (- 5.6)	8.92 (- 1.4)</p>
<p> Re-exports to China	  47.35 (+ 3.7)     36.57 (- 4.4)</p>
<p> Imports from China	  111.52 (+15.2)     98.12 (+11.8)</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
